# AICL Example: Power of Ten
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Is 10^k

Layer:
Core

Behavior Check
    Input: n
    Output: result
    Action:
        if n <= 0:
            return false
        while n > 1:
            if n % 10 != 0:
                return false
            n = n // 10
        return true
